    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-2019-june/q2",
      "question": "<p>The roots of the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-2x^2+4x-5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\"></span>.</p><p>Without solving the equation, find the value of</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac2p+\\dfrac2q+\\dfrac2r\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(p-4)(q-4)(r-4)\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p^3+q^3+r^3\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(8)</span></li></ol>",
